al and thus can be obtained as either of two stereoisomers designated as (R)-(−)-2-pentanol and (S)-(+)-2-pentanol.\n2-Pentanol has been detected in fresh bananas by gas chromatography–mass spectrometry, at an abundance of 14.26±2.63 ppm.", "chimica": "2-Pentanol can be manufactured by hydration of pentene.", "titolo": "2-Pentanol", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2-Pentanol"}, "wikipedia_titoli": {"en": "2-Pentanol"}}